      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VERDUN (7) scored (31.10) last time out over 520m at Wentworth Park nine weeks ago. Drawn wide but with a clean break can feature in the finish. ORARA BOB (2) is a first starter from the Gary Smith yard by Fernando Bale out of One More Burn. Gets every chance from the inside draw. Lot to like about his profile and expected to run well. DANCING GAMBLER (1) comes off an average performance last start when sixth at this track over 350m behind Midnight Gambler (21.09) in a Maiden. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. One of the better hopes. MODEL GAMBLER (8) is a newcomer from the Patrick Lavis kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can sneak into the frame at her first appearance.",
